  "name": "for, since, during, ago, until, by",
  "level": "B1",
  "status": "geprueft",
  "subtitle": "Use for with a length of time and since with a starting point: for two years, since 2024. Use ago after a time in the past, during with an event, until for 'up to' and by for 'no later than'.",
